  "title": "Honey Bran Muffins",
  "description": "Pineapple juice and golden raisins add a fruity sweetness to these bran muffins made with shredded wheat-bran cereal, honey and brown sugar. Since you must refrigerate the batter, mix it up at night so you can bake them up fresh for breakfast in the morning.",
  "authors": [
    "June M"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-05-28T14:43:21-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2022-07-14T17:45:27-04:00",
